  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -AR verb; no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: *secuestrado*",
    "*secuestrar a alguien* = to kidnap someone (*Secuestraron al empresario para pedir rescate* — They kidnapped the businessman to demand a ransom)",
    "*secuestrar un avión/barco* = to hijack a plane/ship",
    "*secuestrar una publicación* = to seize/ban a publication (legal/judicial context)",
    "Related: *el secuestro* = kidnapping, hijacking; *el/la secuestrador/a* = kidnapper, hijacker; *el rescate* = ransom"
  ],
